{"id":"01a0445a-6f42-7a44-b668-5ecf5ec88c7e","issue_id":"project-LICHEN-worker6-l1qw.7.5.2.3","event_type":"updated","actor":"Mark Atwood","old_value":"{\"id\":\"project-LICHEN-worker6-l1qw.7.5.2.3\",\"title\":\"Zephyr: Chat encode/decode\",\"status\":\"in_progress\",\"priority\":1,\"issue_type\":\"task\",\"assignee\":\"Mark Atwood\",\"owner\":\"me@mark.atwood.name\",\"created_at\":\"2026-07-25T03:43:57.107881Z\",\"created_by\":\"Mark Atwood\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-08-27T17:48:20.267768Z\",\"started_at\":\"2026-08-27T17:48:20.267768Z\",\"lease_expires_at\":\"2026-08-27T17:53:20.267768Z\",\"heartbeat_at\":\"2026-08-27T17:48:20.267768Z\",\"dependencies\":[{\"issue_id\":\"project-LICHEN-worker6-l1qw.7.5.2.3\",\"depends_on_id\":\"project-LICHEN-worker6-l1qw.7.5.2\",\"type\":\"parent-child\",\"created_at\":\"2026-07-25T03:43:57.595037Z\",\"created_by\":\"Mark Atwood\",\"metadata\":\"{}\"}]}","new_value":"{\"notes\":\"Implemented isolated Zephyr Compact CoT chat codec with independent Kconfig/CMake selection, preserving the PLI codec. Owned fixed-capacity message structure supports broadcast/team/direct destinations and 0..255 UTF-8 bytes without allocation; encoder returns the exact 3..274 byte size. Both directions are atomic and overlap-safe. Decoder rejects non-chat subtypes, destination types outside 0..2, team IDs outside 1..10, truncated headers/address/message, trailing bytes, and malformed RFC 3629 UTF-8 (overlongs, surrogates, out-of-range code points, bad/truncated continuations). Focused host C strict-warning/UBSan CTest passed 1/1 across all 9 positive canonical chat vectors, 7 negative vectors, max length, NULL, short-buffer, reserved, UTF-8, and overlap cases. cppcheck C11 and diff-check passed; PLI C regression 1/1; Python Compact CoT 87/87; Rust canonical vectors 4/4.\"}","created_at":"2026-08-27T17:52:52.546673Z"}
